#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:317
msgid "Startup command"
msgstr "Comando de inicio"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:321
msgid ""
"If custom startup command is provided, it will be executed instead of the "
"default"
msgstr ""
"Si se proporciona un comando de inicio personalizado, se ejecutará en lugar "
"del predeterminado"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:336
msgid ""
"Optional. If set, the app's code is fetched from this repository and reset "
"to its latest commit every time the container starts, before install/startup"
" runs."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Si se establece, el código de la aplicación se obtiene de este "
"repositorio y se restablece a su último commit cada vez que se inicia el "
"contenedor, antes de ejecutar la instalación/inicio."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:341
msgid ""
"Only https:// URLs are supported, and only public repositories - for a "
"private repo, generate a personal access token and embed it in the URL, e.g."
