"Detects the installed webserver (Apache, Nginx, LiteSpeed or OpenResty) and "
"creates the reverse-proxy configuration for the domain."
msgstr ""
"Detecta el servidor web instalado (Apache, Nginx, LiteSpeed u OpenResty) y "
"crea la configuración del proxy inverso para el dominio."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:466
msgid "Configuring reverse proxy"
msgstr "Configurando proxy inverso"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:470
msgid ""
"Restarts the webserver container so the new reverse-proxy configuration is "
"applied."
msgstr ""
"Reinicia el contenedor del servidor web para que se aplique la nueva "
"configuración del proxy inverso."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:472
msgid "Restarting webserver"
msgstr "Reiniciando servidor web"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:476
#: internal/web/templates/manager/php_install.html:176
msgid ""
"Records the new application in the database so it appears in Site Manager."
msgstr ""
"Registra la nueva aplicación en la base de datos para que aparezca en el "
"Administrador de sitios."

